---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../data/site.js';
---
<SiteLayout>
  <section class="lab-hero">
    <div class="hero-image" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-inside">
      <div class="lab-kicker">ERZİNCAN · ARAŞTIRMA PROJESİ · AFET SOSYOLOJİSİ</div>
      <h1>Toplumsal hafıza ile<br/>afet risk yönetimini<br/><span>buluşturuyoruz.</span></h1>
      <p>Deprem deneyimini, kuşaklararası hafızayı ve mekânsal verileri bir araya getirerek Erzincan’ın sosyal zarar görebilirliğini araştırıyoruz.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="hero-primary" href={href('proje/')}>Projeyi inceleyin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="hero-outline" href={href('haritalar/')}>Veri ve haritalar <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-credit"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Erzincan_Views_across_town_in_2006_2873.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Erzincan görünümü (2006) · Dosseman · CC BY-SA 4.0 · renk/kontrast uyarlaması</a></div>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="lab-stats" aria-label="Araştırmanın planlanan kapsamı">
      <div class="lab-stat"><span class="stat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><div><strong>85</strong><span>Çalışma kapsamındaki mahalle</span></div></div>
      <div class="lab-stat"><span class="stat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▱</span><div><strong>1.093</strong><span>Planlanan hane anketi</span></div></div>
      <div class="lab-stat"><span class="stat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</span><div><strong>3</strong><span>Araştırma aşaması</span></div></div>
      <div class="lab-stat"><span class="stat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><div><strong>1939 / 1992</strong><span>Erzincan’ın deprem hafızası</span></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="lab-section">
      <div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">ARAŞTIRMANIN ODAĞI</span><h2>Deprem riskini hafıza üzerinden yeniden okumak.</h2></div><a href={href('arastirma/')} class="section-more">Araştırma yöntemimiz ↗</a></div>
      <p class="section-lead">Aynı kentte yaşayanlar depremi farklı biçimlerde hatırlar. MNEMORİSK, bu deneyimlerin risk algısına, hazırlık davranışlarına ve yaşanılan yerle kurulan bağa etkisini araştırır.</p>
      <div class="lab-cards">
        <a href={href('arastirma/')} class="lab-card"><div class="card-number">01 / SAHA ARAŞTIRMASI</div><div class="card-icon">◎</div><h3>Hane anketleri</h3><p>Deprem deneyimi, aktarılan anlatılar, risk algısı ve hazırlık davranışları.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href={href('arastirma/')} class="lab-card"><div class="card-number">02 / NİTEL ÇALIŞMA</div><div class="card-icon">◉</div><h3>Derinlemesine görüşmeler</h3><p>Depremi yaşayanların, anlatıları devralanların ve yerel aktörlerin deneyimleri.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href={href('haritalar/')} class="lab-card"><div class="card-number">03 / MEKÂNSAL ANALİZ</div><div class="card-icon">▦</div><h3>Veri ve haritalar</h3><p>Toplumsal hafızanın fiziksel risk göstergeleriyle birlikte değerlendirilmesi.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="data-feature">
      <div class="feature-copy"><div class="eyebrow">VERİ LABORATUVARI / HAZIRLIK AŞAMASI</div><h2>Hafızadan mekânsal analize.</h2><p>Projenin hedefi, toplumsal hafızayı sosyal zarar görebilirlik haritalarına eklemek ve yerel afet planlamasına katkı sunabilecek göstergeler geliştirmek.</p><a class="button" href={href('haritalar/')}>Haritalar bölümünü keşfedin ↗</a></div>
      <div class="feature-graphic" role="img" aria-label="Henüz veri içermeyen, planlanan mekânsal analizleri temsil eden soyut veri ağı">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 500 320" aria-hidden="true"><defs><pattern id="grid" width="27" height="27" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M27 0H0V27" fill="none" stroke="#b9d0dc" stroke-width=".8"/></pattern></defs><rect width="500" height="320" fill="#eaf2f7"/><rect width="500" height="320" fill="url(#grid)"/><g fill="none" stroke="#648ca7" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M30 225Q125 130 185 192T338 109T475 95"/><path d="M20 88Q160 145 245 95T480 205"/><path d="M100 10Q130 180 235 310"/><path d="M345 0Q267 175 433 320"/></g><g fill="#c3755c" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"><circle cx="185" cy="192" r="9"/><circle cx="338" cy="109" r="9"/><circle cx="245" cy="95" r="9"/></g><g fill="#204c67"><circle cx="75" cy="153" r="5"/><circle cx="393" cy="220" r="5"/><circle cx="285" cy="269" r="5"/></g></svg>
        <span class="graphic-label">ŞEMATİK GÖSTERİM · GERÇEK ARAŞTIRMA VERİSİ DEĞİLDİR</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="lab-section">
      <div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">ARAŞTIRMA ÇIKTILARI</span><h2>Bilimsel yayınlar ve proje haberleri.</h2></div><a href={href('yayinlar/')} class="section-more">Tüm içerikler ↗</a></div>
      <div class="empty-feed"><strong>Yayın arşivi hazırlanıyor.</strong><p>Makale, rapor, bilimsel bildiri ve saha notları yayımlandıkça bu bölümde yer alacak.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <style>
    .lab-hero{min-height:540px;position:relative;color:#fff;background:#294e65;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-image{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Erzincan_Views_across_town_in_2006_2873.jpg?width=1600');background-size:cover;background-position:center 45%;z-index:-2}
    .hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,41,60,.95) 0%,rgba(15,48,68,.81) 42%,rgba(13,43,62,.18) 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(6,28,44,.55),transparent 38%);z-index:-1}
    .hero-inside{padding:91px 0 105px}.lab-kicker{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700;color:#c2e0ee}
    .lab-hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,4.6vw,62px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.12;margin:23px 0}
    .lab-hero h1 span{color:#d1e8f0}
    .lab-hero p{max-width:610px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#e3edf2;margin:0}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}
    .hero-primary,.hero-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:14px 19px;min-height:49px}
    .hero-primary{background:white;color:#173b54}.hero-outline{border:1px solid #dbe9f1;color:white;background:#183d56aa}
    .hero-primary:hover{background:#e4eef4}.hero-outline:hover{background:#204f6c}
    .photo-credit{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:max(25px,calc((100vw - 1220px)/2));font-size:10px;color:#eaf0f4;opacity:.9;text-align:right}
    .photo-credit a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
    .lab-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5eb;border-top:0}
    .lab-stat{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:27px 21px;min-width:0}
    .lab-stat+.lab-stat{border-left:1px solid #dce5eb}
    .stat-symbol{font-size:29px;color:#2c6687}
    .lab-stat strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(21px,2vw,29px);letter-spacing:-.035em;white-space:nowrap}
    .lab-stat div>span{font-size:12px;color:#6a7c8b;line-height:1.4}
    .lab-section{padding:73px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5eb}
    .section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;align-items:end}
    .lab-section h2,.data-feature h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3.4vw,43px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.2;margin:13px 0 0;max-width:810px}
    .section-more{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#225876;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:1px solid #9db9c9;padding-bottom:7px}
    .section-lead{max-width:800px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#607487;margin-top:23px}
    .lab-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:17px;margin-top:32px}
    .lab-card{position:relative;display:block;background:white;border:1px solid #d9e4eb;padding:24px;min-height:257px;transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s}
    .lab-card:hover{border-color:#8cafc3;transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .card-number{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;color:#587a90;font-weight:700}
    .card-icon{font-size:30px;color:#28617e;margin-top:20px}
    .lab-card h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:12px 0}
    .lab-card p{font-size:15px;color:#607487;line-height:1.6;max-width:340px}
    .card-arrow{position:absolute;right:23px;bottom:18px;color:#2f6683}
    .data-feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:#edf3f7;border:1px solid #dbe4eb;margin:52px 0 0;overflow:hidden}
    .feature-copy{padding:clamp(26px,3.7vw,52px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;justify-content:center}
    .feature-copy p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#566e80;margin:20px 0 9px}
    .feature-graphic{position:relative;min-height:325px;overflow:hidden}
    .feature-graphic svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0}
    .graphic-label{position:absolute;bottom:16px;left:18px;background:#ffffffeb;color:#416477;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px}
    .empty-feed{margin-top:28px;border:1px solid #dce5eb;background:white;padding:29px}
    .empty-feed strong{font-size:19px}.empty-feed p{font-size:15px;color:#607487;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:0}
    @media(max-width:900px){.lab-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.lab-stat:nth-child(3){border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #dce5eb}.lab-stat:nth-child(4){border-top:1px solid #dce5eb}.lab-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-card{min-height:210px}.data-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature-graphic{min-height:250px}.section-top{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}}
    @media(max-width:600px){.lab-hero{min-height:0}.hero-inside{padding:70px 0 85px}.lab-hero h1{font-size:clamp(35px,9vw,47px)}.lab-hero p{font-size:16px}.lab-kicker{font-size:10px}.hero-actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}.hero-actions a{justify-content:space-between}.photo-credit{right:16px;left:16px;font-size:9px}.lab-stat{padding:18px 12px;gap:7px}.stat-symbol{font-size:21px}.lab-stat strong{font-size:21px}.lab-stat div>span{font-size:11px}.lab-section{padding:50px 0}.section-lead{font-size:16px}.data-feature{margin-top:32px}.graphic-label{font-size:9px}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>